    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/extras/a606684a4290819124a5bfa3024a67f0.poster.avif?t=1754505062\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/extras/a606684a4290819124a5bfa3024a67f0.webm?t=1754505062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/extras/a606684a4290819124a5bfa3024a67f0.mp4?t=1754505062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>A unique blend of gameplay has fans saying it is, &quot;<i>Re-Defining A Genre.</i>&quot;</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After letting his girlfriend down for the last time, Billy is swiftly dumped on his two-year anniversary. While walking home alone in the rain, a mysterious portal swallows him up and spits him out on a distant alien world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is here that Billy will learn to become the dependable person he should have always been.<br>Oh, and save the world, too. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/extras/da844faad25a710a4edec1af14548cf4.poster.avif?t=1754505062\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/extras/da844faad25a710a4edec1af14548cf4.webm?t=1754505062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/extras/da844faad25a710a4edec1af14548cf4.mp4?t=1754505062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Billy Saves the World</strong> gives players ultimate freedom: You can head straight to the end for a more challenging experience or you can explore the 2D open-world to find  upgrades, dozens of NPCs, and puzzles that will help you on your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lean toward action platforming or solve puzzles -- whichever you prefer, to get it done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/extras/9c97ff5efcb957651b9e837312c11d8b.avif?t=1754505062\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring\u00a0<strong>5 to 20+ hours</strong> of gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Contains one of the year's best soundtracks</strong>, composed by John McMillan (Assassin's Creed IV: Black Flag) and multi-platinum producer Tom Ratesic (Nicki Minaj, Lil Wayne). And audio by Jonathan Beres (Game of Thrones).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your dialogue in this comedic sci-fi love story that appears silly on the surface but offers a meaningful message of personal growth &amp; acceptance, written by <strong>award-winning filmmaker, Cooper Bibaud.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/extras/d755022d836124dd437c772c7e4753f6.poster.avif?t=1754505062\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/extras/d755022d836124dd437c772c7e4753f6.webm?t=1754505062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/extras/d755022d836124dd437c772c7e4753f6.mp4?t=1754505062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Run, Slide, Jump, Rocket-Boost, Wall-Jump, and use Jedi-like super powers</strong> to explore a dense 2D metroidvania-style open world, featuring 7+ diverse biomes with beautifully hand drawn environments and animation from top film &amp; tv professionals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve over <strong>25 side-quests</strong> with multiple dialogue branches, solutions and outcomes based on what you say and do. Packed with <strong>30+ optional levels to beat</strong>, each containing different routes<strong>,</strong> unique enemies, deadly traps, creative puzzles, secret collectibles, and nail biting time trials.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Join the official Discord channel for the latest news &amp; announcements, chat directly with the creator, PLUS receive exclusive videos, images, WIPs and more.</strong></u><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/extras/02533f6f19b9d8bde4e8c03e6b929492.avif?t=1754505062\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/extras/a606684a4290819124a5bfa3024a67f0.poster.avif?t=1754505062\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/extras/a606684a4290819124a5bfa3024a67f0.webm?t=1754505062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/extras/a606684a4290819124a5bfa3024a67f0.mp4?t=1754505062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>A unique blend of gameplay has fans saying it is, &quot;<i>Re-Defining A Genre.</i>&quot;</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After letting his girlfriend down for the last time, Billy is swiftly dumped on his two-year anniversary. While walking home alone in the rain, a mysterious portal swallows him up and spits him out on a distant alien world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It is here that Billy will learn to become the dependable person he should have always been.<br>Oh, and save the world, too. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/extras/da844faad25a710a4edec1af14548cf4.poster.avif?t=1754505062\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/extras/da844faad25a710a4edec1af14548cf4.webm?t=1754505062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/extras/da844faad25a710a4edec1af14548cf4.mp4?t=1754505062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Billy Saves the World</strong> gives players ultimate freedom: You can head straight to the end for a more challenging experience or you can explore the 2D open-world to find  upgrades, dozens of NPCs, and puzzles that will help you on your quest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lean toward action platforming or solve puzzles -- whichever you prefer, to get it done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/extras/9c97ff5efcb957651b9e837312c11d8b.avif?t=1754505062\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Featuring\u00a0<strong>5 to 20+ hours</strong> of gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Contains one of the year's best soundtracks</strong>, composed by John McMillan (Assassin's Creed IV: Black Flag) and multi-platinum producer Tom Ratesic (Nicki Minaj, Lil Wayne). And audio by Jonathan Beres (Game of Thrones).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your dialogue in this comedic sci-fi love story that appears silly on the surface but offers a meaningful message of personal growth &amp; acceptance, written by <strong>award-winning filmmaker, Cooper Bibaud.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/extras/d755022d836124dd437c772c7e4753f6.poster.avif?t=1754505062\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/extras/d755022d836124dd437c772c7e4753f6.webm?t=1754505062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/extras/d755022d836124dd437c772c7e4753f6.mp4?t=1754505062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Run, Slide, Jump, Rocket-Boost, Wall-Jump, and use Jedi-like super powers</strong> to explore a dense 2D metroidvania-style open world, featuring 7+ diverse biomes with beautifully hand drawn environments and animation from top film &amp; tv professionals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve over <strong>25 side-quests</strong> with multiple dialogue branches, solutions and outcomes based on what you say and do. Packed with <strong>30+ optional levels to beat</strong>, each containing different routes<strong>,</strong> unique enemies, deadly traps, creative puzzles, secret collectibles, and nail biting time trials.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Join the official Discord channel for the latest news &amp; announcements, chat directly with the creator, PLUS receive exclusive videos, images, WIPs and more.</strong></u><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1390420/extras/02533f6f19b9d8bde4e8c03e6b929492.avif?t=1754505062\" /></div></p>",
